  "_meaning_about": "Groups of colors that mean different things. carriedBy says what besides color tells them apart: text (a word beside each mark), shape, or none. A group carried by none must stay 20 or more apart under protanopia, deuteranopia, tritanopia, and achromatopsia (scripts/design/cvd.js).",
